Every year, millions of sharks are killed for their fins.
Without their fins, the sharks cannot swim and soon die.
Sharks are at the top of the food chain.
We should all help save the sharks.', '如今鲨鱼正处于危险之中。
每年都有数百万条鲨鱼因鱼鳍而被杀。
没有了鳍,鲨鱼无法游泳,很快就会死去。
鲨鱼处于食物链的顶端。
我们都应该帮助拯救鲨鱼。', 'us_female', '[{"q": "Are sharks in danger?", "type": "choice", "answer": "B", "options": ["Sometimes.", "Yes.", "Not anymore.", "No."]}, {"q": "Why are sharks killed?", "type": "choice", "answer": "C", "options": ["For food.", "For their skin.", "For their fins.", "For sport."]}, {"q": "What happens without their fins?", "type": "choice", "answer": "B", "options": ["They swim faster.", "They cannot swim and soon die.", "They get healthy.", "They grow bigger."]}, {"q": "Where are sharks in the food chain?", "type": "choice", "answer": "D", "options": ["Outside it.", "At the bottom.", "In the middle.", "At the top."]}, {"q": "What should we do?", "type": "choice", "answer": "D", "options": ["Catch more sharks.", "Eat more fins.", "Do nothing.", "Help save the sharks."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'short', '9', 'U13');
